          50351b9ff7709edf t("Each kind of text is a font, a size, a weight, how far apart its lines are and how its letters are spaced, each a token, as look's Type has them. The design system has the same names, and a test holds its values to the app's.",SF Pro Text,14,r,align(l),lh(1.6071),ls(-0.1498px)) p(0,30) s(fill,hug:45) ext(888,) f[(78d6c21e8aff87aa,tok(color.text.muted,#B8B1AC))] $typography.Body "Purpose"
