            650545dc2ffd7b4c t("Where nothing sets them, a kind's lines are the golden ratio of its size apart, and a place that sets its own sets them as a share of the size, so they follow the reach. Code's are set by where it's read, and a key's are as tall as the key. Letters are spaced as macOS spaces its own system font at each size.",SF Pro Text,14,r,align(l),lh(1.6071),ls(-0.1498px)) p(0,26.5) s(fill,hug:67.5) ext(888,) f[(0022e2755aa14a4a,tok(color.text.muted,#B8B1AC))] $typography.Body "Purpose"
