  ce1ab09497772fd4 t("The agent's Markdown headings are sized by the kit, as shares of the text they're in: a top-level heading is 25.2px, bigger than a page title's 24px, which look.md calls the largest kind. Inline code is 12.25px, 0.875 of body text. Neither is one of the app's kinds.",SF Pro Text,14,r,align(l),lh(1.6071),ls(-0.1498px)) p(24,87) s(720,hug:67.5) f[(1bc972ee0ce3e3fd,tok(color.text.muted,#B8B1AC))] $typography.Body "Between"
