  030e8446bd51d160 t("You chose 25px for body text on a handheld, as the chat draws it, where its option said no picture would move. Built as body text's own lines, as a key's kinds have, it moved 21 of the iPhone's pictures by a pixel or two. So what's open is how far 25px reaches. Elsewhere body text stays on the golden ratio's 27.5px.",SF Pro Text,14,r,align(l),lh(1.6071),ls(-0.1498px)) p(24,87) s(720,hug:67.5) f[(d2c85cfe51ed4438,tok(color.text.muted,#B8B1AC))] $typography.Body "Between"
